<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia Avto Celje to list on OTC on Feb 4.</title>
<headline>Slovenia Avto Celje to list on OTC on Feb 4.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Car trader and repair company Avto Celje will list its shares on the over-the-counter (OTC) market of the Ljubljana Stock Exchange on February 4, the bourse said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The company will list 326,099 shares with a nominal value of 1,000 tolars ($6.7), representing 78 percent of its equity.</p>
<p>Avto Celje will enlarge a group of 26 newly privatised companies that have been listed on the main or OTC market of the Ljubljana bourse since January 1996.</p>
<p>At the moment there are 25 shares traded on the main market and another 29 on the OTC segment of the Ljubljana bourse. -- Marja Novak, Ljubljana Newsroom, 386-61-126-3644</p>
</text>
